            "source_key": "da777bf33a44b340e528",
            "source_type": "OCR_CONTEXT",
            "text": "F  The  Republic  of  Sale  formally  came  into  existence  before  1614.  However,  its  origins  date  to  1590  when  al-Mansur \ngranted  the  corsairs  there  a  great  degree  of  autonomy.  As  his  successors  proved  incapable  of  providing  the  basic \nnecessities  of  safety,  harbor  maintenance,  etc,  the  local  populace  shouldered  those  responsibilities  and  withdrew \ntheir  allegiance  to  the  sultan  as  early  as  1609.",
            "locator_status": "ACQUIRED_TEXT_RANGE",
            "text_locator": {
              "url": "https://archive.org/details/2020-tr-of-sale-et-ses-corsaires-1666-1727-maziane-2009",
